{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Didi and Jeong Tae-woong's Yomojomo of Korean Life"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hello, this is Didi."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hello, this is Jeong Tae-woong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yomojomo of Korean Life is a podcast where two people living in Korea talk about the various aspects of Korean life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the tenth episode this week, and what's the topic this time?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This tenth episode's topic is middle school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Teacher Tae-woong, what comes to mind when you think of middle school?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I think of middle school, just like with elementary school,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When do you grow up?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hanging in there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hanging in there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the way, last time we actually talked more about our own elementary school experiences rather than elementary school itself, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I think that was unavoidable because there are a lot of things I don't remember well,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this time I'll try to talk as much as possible focusing on things that happened within middle school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Would you like to start, Didi? How was middle school for you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I think of middle school, what comes to mind is dark history."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dark history?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can only think of dark history."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I could erase my middle school years, I would want to erase them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93000,
    "dDurationMs": 12000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Middle school is, in international age, from 12 to 14? Or 13 to 15? Around that range,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's the puberty period, right? The stormy period."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, that's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you rebelled against your parents and broke rules that you were supposed to follow?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I have quite a few memories I'd like to erase."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now that I think about it, I'm the same way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It makes sense that Korea has a word called \"middle school second-year syndrome.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That exists, right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Middle school second-year syndrome, a kind of mental illness that children get in their second year of middle school?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Being rebellious and getting caught up in the idea that you're the coolest person in the world,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wonder if that kind of period exists worldwide."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm sure it does."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Teacher Tae-woong, it seems like you went through puberty quite a bit?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I did."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What kind of symptoms did you have?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 164000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I got angry a lot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Got angry a lot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, I got angry a lot and also felt depressed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Overall it seemed like I was very up and down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Frustrated and upset for no clear reason,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I really felt the hormonal changes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, hormones are scary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You didn't rebel against your parents or anything? Not talking to them?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I did a bit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What I remember is,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I was in middle school, my mother was working at a math academy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She wasn't teaching math, but she worked at the academy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I attended that academy too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there was a male teacher there that I really liked, respected, and followed closely,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that teacher was a very kind person,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wonder if mom told the teacher that I was going through puberty,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That teacher, with a smiling face,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tae-woong, don't get too angry at mom these days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He said something like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 250000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I felt a bit stung at that moment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, so I'm going through puberty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even so, when I heard things like \"you're a good person\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'd go to my mom and ask why she'd say that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 263000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have to go that far for it to be adolescence, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't think I was able to actually do that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're kind, you had a well-behaved adolescence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I didn't cause major trouble or anything like that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I also don't think I caused trouble or anything like that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But why do you want to erase it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Should I say I was a bit mischievous?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In middle school I played a lot of mischievous pranks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On teachers and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh what"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It wasn't me, I'm telling you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow, that's shocking?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it wasn't like I got seriously scolded"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or received serious punishment at school or anything like that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I think those were pranks that could be overlooked"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I didn't focus during class and played around with friends"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And kind of teased the teacher a bit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 330000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have memories of doing that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Playing pranks and on the teacher"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you just hear it that way, it doesn't sound like much"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can you tell me in more detail?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 345000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What could I even talk about?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 349000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What is there to talk about?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 353000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like notes where I cursed out the teacher during class"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was passing them back and forth with friends and got caught"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 360000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do I do"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I went to the front of the classroom and got hit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 366000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You were a troublemaker, a real troublemaker"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was a troublemaker, a prankster"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wonder how annoying it must have been for the teacher"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they must have been annoyed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It wasn't like that for all three years"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 381000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it was like that through first and second year of middle school"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was influenced a lot by my friends too"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 388000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My friends in first year of middle school were mischievous kids"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not like kids who just played around"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 395000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Kids who liked to prank and stuff like that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why did I do that? I'm really sorry, teacher"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If it were now, I wouldn't do that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was less mature back then"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are so many adults I wronged back then"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are so many people I'm sorry to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I really committed a betrayal of trust"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But because I did those things"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 424000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When another young person makes a mistake with me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 432000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think I become a bit more forgiving"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 434000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thinking about it that way is comforting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I did that too back then"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, right, that's when it happens"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 440000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's how it became for me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 442000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Later on I'll regret it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 446000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll think about it a bit more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, I think I've already talked about pretty serious pranks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So please just know up to that point"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This level was within the range of pranks I could talk about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 466000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Didi from back then"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was not me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 470000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Back then, we weren't like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 473000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Back then, it was an opinion that many people could have disagreed with,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 479000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but at that time I just"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 481000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "still thought of them as practically no different from animals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 486000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, a child with a grown body."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 489000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 491000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not socialized."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 495000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Was your school uniform pretty?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 499000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 500000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Was your middle school uniform pretty?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Everything else was fine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the mai, the winter jacket? The outer garment?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I didn't really like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 514000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The color?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 515000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, the color was gray,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the fabric was rough like non-woven material."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 523000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Scratchy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 524000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, so"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 526000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That winter uniform, the clothes you wear in winter—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 528000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when you put on that mai, that jacket of the school uniform, that outer garment,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 535000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that rough non-woven-like fabric"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 539000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "keeps tickling your neck."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 544000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I really hated it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was the worst."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not only was it not pretty, but it was uncomfortable too?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 549000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, so my neck was always itchy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 552000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why did they do it that way?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 554000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I know, right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 556000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think I really disliked the school uniform."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 560000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You didn't like wearing the uniform?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 562000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There were pros and cons."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 565000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You don't have to worry about what to wear, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 568000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's the advantage that you just put on this one thing and you're done,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 573000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but having to always wear that same outfit without any choice felt so suffocating,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so bothersome,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 586000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by middle school you start to care about style, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 591000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some friends would alter their uniforms"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 595000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or shorten their pants and things like that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 599000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how was it for you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600000,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I didn't do that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 601680,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ohhh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 603000,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 605480,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was a well-behaved student, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 606800,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, I just wore it as it was, as they gave it to me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 610480,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Aww, how good of you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 613480,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I didn't have the courage to actually shorten it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 617480,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "skirts were usually worn short back then,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 622000,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I didn't shorten mine, I just folded it like this to wear it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 625480,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I remember folding it to make it shorter and wearing it that way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630480,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The length?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 632480,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when you wear the length that short like that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 636480,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's always a teacher standing in front of the school gate when you arrive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 638480,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 639480,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they call you over."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 641480,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"You, come here.\" And they measure it with a ruler."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 645480,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you think about it now, isn't that really strange?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 649480,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it not like that anymore? Not at all anymore?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 651480,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Isn't it still like that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 653480,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 654480,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I understand that now they don't crack down unless it's really severe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 659480,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what I was trying to talk about was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 662480,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hair length inspections, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 666480,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 667480,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hair length inspections."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 668480,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I graduated elementary school and entered middle school"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 673480,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the thing that had the biggest impact, that really intimidated me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 679480,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that system, that rule was the hair length inspection system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684480,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There were restrictions on your hair, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 686480,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. Hair length."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 689480,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If your hair grew past a certain number of centimeters, you couldn't do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 693480,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What was the standard for boys?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 696480,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At the middle school I attended"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 698480,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how much was it? Two centimeters? Three centimeters?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 701480,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, how, by what standard?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 704480,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Was it the sideburns area?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 708480,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your sideburns had to be short?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 711480,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. The sideburns and the back of the hair, I think?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 714480,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For girls there was a strict rule. A certain number of centimeters below the ears."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718480,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was gone by the time I was in middle school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 720480,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was gone?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 721480,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was gone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 723480,
    "dDurationMs": 4999,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think they did it until first year of middle school and then it was gone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 728479,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow, even back then the teachers at the school gate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 732479,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when students would rush in in the morning"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 735479,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would just look and if they thought my hair was a bit long"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 739479,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they'd say come here and measure it with a ruler"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 743479,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and say your hair was this many centimeters long."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 746479,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Longer than this many centimeters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 749479,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then they'd record which grade, which class, which number student you were"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 753479,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 755479,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's how they'd check. Next time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 757479,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The problem with recording it like that was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 760479,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sometimes they'd give you punishment right away"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 763479,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or make you stay after school and things like that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 765479,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or it would all go into your grades, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 768479,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When applying to high school they'd record all the demerits and stuff like that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 774479,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and to get rid of it you'd have to do volunteer work and things like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 779479,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I really don't know what they were doing it for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 783479,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it seemed like they were saying study."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 787479,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Don't worry about anything else and just study."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 790479,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Don't try to look cool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 795479,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So a student like me would have my hair cut"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 803479,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and wear uncomfortable, ill-fitting clothes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 808479,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and sit through from first period to sixth period and beyond"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 814479,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just enduring it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 818479,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You didn't do well in school?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 821479,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I started doing well from high school onwards."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 825479,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really? You didn't do well before that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 827479,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I didn't."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 829479,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That was okay?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 830479,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It didn't stick in my hands and I couldn't grasp it and it didn't enter my eyes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 836479,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had no interest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 839479,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when I went to high school I did reasonably well"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 843479,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but in middle school the teachers seemed to think I was really strange."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 850479,
    "dDurationMs": 8001,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My attitude in class was really good but whenever I took a test my grades were really low."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 858480,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your good attitude in class was just you enduring it, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 861480,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 862480,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Steadfastly?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 863480,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 864480,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's really unusual too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 866480,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this guy didn't even sleep."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 873480,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And he wasn't a troublemaker either."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 877480,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when you ask him to answer, he doesn't know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 881480,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you ask him to answer, he's like, \"What's the answer?\" and he doesn't know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 885480,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He doesn't understand what you're talking about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 891480,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But even though he's a good kid, when he takes a test, he gets all the problems wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 898480,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What were you doing back then?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 902480,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What were you doing back then?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 905480,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think I was drawing pictures up until then too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 908480,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In middle school, I watched a lot of movies."
