  }, {
    "tStartMs": 959480,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I kept rapping to myself continuously."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 965480,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh right. And I did beatboxing."
