  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1936000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it changed to the voice I have now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1940000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So as a side effect, I can't hit high notes."
