  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1948000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I can't sing well either."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1951000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's why I really hate noraebang."
